From: Nex package maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] ifconfig: allow builds to override the proc network path
Source: Nex
Upstream: not submitted; Nex only needs the compile-time override hook

Keep the normal /proc/net/dev default while allowing a build to provide a
different PATH_PROCNET_DEV definition.

diff --git a/ifconfig/system/linux.c b/ifconfig/system/linux.c
index dd5dd24..ad12920 100644
--- a/ifconfig/system/linux.c
+++ b/ifconfig/system/linux.c
@@ -51,6 +51,10 @@
 #include "../ifconfig.h"
 
 
+#ifndef PATH_PROCNET_DEV
+ #define PATH_PROCNET_DEV "/proc/net/dev"
+#endif
+
 /* ARPHRD stuff.  */
 
 static void
